{"id": "en_story_mary_celeste", "tag": "UNSOLVED", "cta": "MORE TRUE STORIES LIKE THIS", "ctaSmall": "follow", "ctaWhere": "new story every day", "accent": "#9BD3FF", "lang": "en", "total": 69.91, "segments": [{"text": "A ghost ship drifts silently across the cold ocean with every single human soul completely missing.", "start": 0.0, "end": 5.4}, {"text": "On 4 December 1872, the watchful crew of the Dei Gratia spots a strange floating vessel.", "start": 6.0, "end": 10.98}, {"text": "This mystery ship is drifting in the Atlantic ocean between the Azores and Portugal right now.", "start": 11.64, "end": 15.96}, {"text": "Sailors quickly pull alongside the silent vessel and discover it is named the Mary Celeste.", "start": 16.88, "end": 20.7}, {"text": "They climb carefully onto the quiet wooden deck, but absolutely nobody is found on board today.", "start": 21.3, "end": 25.78}, {"text": "The drifting ship is completely seaworthy, floating safely over the deep rolling ocean water now.", "start": 26.34, "end": 30.94}, {"text": "Plenty of fresh food and drinking water are still stored securely right on the ship.", "start": 31.82, "end": 35.06}, {"text": "Down below in the hold, most of its large cargo of alcohol remains completely intact today.", "start": 36.06, "end": 40.18}, {"text": "The crew looks closely and notices that only its single lifeboat is missing from deck.", "start": 41.46, "end": 44.98}, {"text": "Captain Benjamin Briggs and his entire crew are gone, and they are never found again anywhere.", "start": 45.86, "end": 49.84}, {"text": "His wife and their young daughter are also gone, completely vanished from the face of earth.", "start": 50.5, "end": 54.24}, {"text": "No sign of any human life remains, and these people are never found by anyone.", "start": 54.92, "end": 58.7}, {"text": "To this day, nobody knows for sure why all these people suddenly left their ship.", "start": 59.5, "end": 62.88}, {"text": "Why do you think they abandoned a perfectly seawo